WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.834
F1.3 · Tenants, entities and reporting axes

2
00:00:05.984 --> 00:00:10.208
A tenant is one client account, fully isolated from every other.

3
00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:14.952
Inside it, entities are the legal companies, each with its own currency.

4
00:00:16.102 --> 00:00:20.573
A group with a US, a UK and a French company has three entities.

5
00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:22.942
USD, GBP and EUR.

6
00:00:25.102 --> 00:00:29.703
Beside entities, K-φ reports by business unit and by third party.

7
00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:34.772
The same customer is the same third party in the ledger and in the invoices.

8
00:00:35.922 --> 00:00:38.683
The axes are the selectors in the top bar.

9
00:00:42.922 --> 00:00:46.766
Settle the entity list and the business units with the client first.

10
00:00:46.816 --> 00:00:49.999
A wrong entity list shows up everywhere downstream.

11
